[I] Audio tagger implemented in Python

[T] Mutagen is a Python module to handle audio metadata. It supports ASF,
[T] FLAC, MP4, Monkey's Audio, MP3, Musepack, Ogg Opus, FLAC, Speex, Theora
[T] and Vorbis, True Audio, WavPack, OptimFROG and AIFF files, with all
[T] ID3v2 versions and frames.

[U] https://github.com/quodlibet/mutagen

[A] Mutagen Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

